        "paragraph_bAKWTy": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_size": "md",
            "paragraph_width": "full",
            "text_color": "primary",
            "content": "<p>Dean Safe features 3 showroom locations in Southern California. Each showroom has a large selection of every type of safe you can think of: rifle & pistol safes, home safes, business safes, vault doors, high-security safes, floor & wall safes, used safes, safe accessories, and much more!<br/><br/>The Simi Valley Dean Safe Showroom features a 25,000 Sq. Ft. location with hundreds of in-stock safes, ready to ship in our warehouse, along with a store front display of our most popular items. At this location, Mary and Kelly will help you find exactly what you’re looking for.<br/><br/>The North Hollywood Dean Safe Showroom is located in the San Fernando Valley with an excellent selection of additional available security safes. This location opened in October of 2016. Josh will help you find the perfect safe if you visit or call this location.<br/><br/>The Dean Safe Culver City Showroom, located in the West Los Angeles area, opened its doors in October of 2014. Meet Jacque and Kim, who will assist you in selecting the perfect home or jewelry safe that suit your specific needs.<br/><br/>All Dean Safe locations have a team of experts, where you can order anything from our website but with special in-store savings.<br/><br/></p>"
